# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Cloudflare Workers Static Assets Ignore Rules (Root Safeguard)
# Ensures backend source code, secrets, and build artifacts are never uploaded
# as public static assets if root directory scanning is triggered.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.env
.env.*
.dev.vars
.git/
.gitignore
.claude/
.venv/
venv/
env/
__pycache__/
*.py
*.pyc
worker.js
wrangler.toml
package.json
package-lock.json
node_modules/
.wrangler/
Dockerfile
.dockerignore
render.yaml
requirements.txt
graphify-out/
state/
CLAUDE.md
README.md
LICENSE
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.log
*.map
